  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e3f4c28a-1caa-49d6-806d-b38bc2d13932\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Visit types can be added to the system using the Administration UI at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://local/openmrs/admin/visits/visitType.list\">/openmrs/admin/visits/visitType.list</a></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Steps</h2><p>1) Navigate to <em>OpenMRS, Administration, Manage Visit Types.</em></p><p>2) Add new visit type.</p><p><br /></p><p><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2016-1-20 12:16:1.png\" /></ac:image></p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
