    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e3f4c28a-1caa-49d6-806d-b38bc2d13932\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Visit types can be added to the system using the Administration UI at <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://local/openmrs/admin/visits/visitType.list\" rel=\"nofollow\">/openmrs/admin/visits/visitType.list</a></p></div></div><h2 id=\"ConfigureVisitTypes-Steps\">Steps</h2><p>1) Navigate to <em>OpenMRS, Administration, Manage Visit Types.</em></p><p>2) Add new visit type.</p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945530/image2016-1-20%2012:16:1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1453272377940&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=484&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945530/image2016-1-20%2012:16:1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1453272377940&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945529\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2016-1-20 12:16:1.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945530\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"2\" data-media-id=\"f6e3e849-8374-47a2-8a31-5e9df215744d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945530/image2016-1-20%2012:16:1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1453272377940&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=968&amp;